{"id":"a5cb59116c90aaf7","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/509_Bar_Induction_直觉主义系统.md","title":"509 Bar Induction 直觉主义系统","display":"509_Bar_Induction_直觉主义系统","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始排序与签名\">1. 原始排序与签名</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>排序为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Sort}_{509}=\\{\\mathsf N,\\mathsf Fin,\\mathsf Bar,\\mathsf Pred\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Sort}_{509}=\\{\\mathsf N,\\mathsf Fin,\\mathsf Bar,\\mathsf Pred\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>变量集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}_{509}=\\{v_i^s:i\\in\\mathbb N,s\\in\\mathsf{Sort}_{509}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Var}_{509}^s=\\{v_i^s:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Var}_{509}=\\{v_i^s:i\\in\\mathbb N,s\\in\\mathsf{Sort}_{509}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Var}_{509}^s=\\{v_i^s:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{509}(s,X)=v_m^s\">\\(\\operatorname{fresh}_{509}(s,X)=v_m^s\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=\\min\\{i:v_i^s\\notin X\\}\">\\(m=\\min\\{i:v_i^s\\notin X\\}\\)</span>。函数符号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"0:\\mathsf N,\\quad S:\\mathsf N\\to\\mathsf N,\\quad \\langle\\rangle:\\mathsf Fin,\\quad \\operatorname{cat}:\\mathsf Fin,\\mathsf N\\to\\mathsf Fin.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[0:\\mathsf N,\\quad S:\\mathsf N\\to\\mathsf N,\\quad \\langle\\rangle:\\mathsf Fin,\\quad \\operatorname{cat}:\\mathsf Fin,\\mathsf N\\to\\mathsf Fin.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>关系符号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{InBar}:\\mathsf Bar,\\mathsf Fin,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Bar}:\\mathsf Bar,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Pred}:\\mathsf Pred,\\mathsf Fin.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{InBar}:\\mathsf Bar,\\mathsf Fin,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Bar}:\\mathsf Bar,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Pred}:\\mathsf Pred,\\mathsf Fin.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-项、公式与结构操作\">2. 项、公式与结构操作</h1>\n<p>分排序项族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^s\">\\(\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^s\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小族：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{509}^s\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{509}^s\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^s\">\\(\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^s\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^{\\mathsf N}\">\\(0\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^{\\mathsf N}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^{\\mathsf N}\">\\(u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^{\\mathsf N}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(u)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^{\\mathsf N}\">\\(S(u)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^{\\mathsf N}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^{\\mathsf Fin}\">\\(\\langle\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^{\\mathsf Fin}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^{\\mathsf Fin}\">\\(s\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^{\\mathsf Fin}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^{\\mathsf N}\">\\(n\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^{\\mathsf N}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cat}(s,n)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^{\\mathsf Fin}\">\\(\\operatorname{cat}(s,n)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^{\\mathsf Fin}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义总项族</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathsf{Sort}_{509}}\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^s.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathsf{Sort}_{509}}\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^s.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^s\">\\(t,u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^s\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=u\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\">\\(t=u\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^{\\mathsf Bar}\">\\(B\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^{\\mathsf Bar}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^{\\mathsf Fin}\">\\(s\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^{\\mathsf Fin}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{InBar}(B,s)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\">\\(\\operatorname{InBar}(B,s)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^{\\mathsf Bar}\">\\(B\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^{\\mathsf Bar}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Bar}(B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\">\\(\\operatorname{Bar}(B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^{\\mathsf Pred}\">\\(P\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^{\\mathsf Pred}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^{\\mathsf Fin}\">\\(s\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^{\\mathsf Fin}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pred}(P,s)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\">\\(\\operatorname{Pred}(P,s)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\land B,A\\lor B,A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\">\\(A\\land B,A\\lor B,A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{509}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{509}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall xA,\\exists xA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\">\\(\\forall xA,\\exists xA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}\">\\(\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}\\)</span> 由</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(0)=\\varnothing,\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(\\langle\\rangle)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(0)=\\varnothing,\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(\\langle\\rangle)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(S(u))=\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(u),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(\\operatorname{cat}(s,n))=\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(S(u))=\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(u),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(\\operatorname{cat}(s,n))=\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{509}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{509}\\)</span> 由</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(t=u)=\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(u),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(t=u)=\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(u),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(\\operatorname{InBar}(B,s))=\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(s),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(\\operatorname{InBar}(B,s))=\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(s),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(\\operatorname{Bar}(B))=\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(\\operatorname{Pred}(P,s))=\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(P)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(s),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(\\operatorname{Bar}(B))=\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(\\operatorname{Pred}(P,s))=\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(P)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(s),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(A\\land B)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(A\\lor B)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(A\\land B)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(A\\lor B)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(A\\to B)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(A\\to B)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(\\exists xA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(\\exists xA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>绑定变量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{509}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{509})\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{509}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{509})\\)</span> 定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(t=u)=\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(\\operatorname{InBar}(B,s))=\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(\\operatorname{Bar}(B))=\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(\\operatorname{Pred}(P,s))=\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(t=u)=\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(\\operatorname{InBar}(B,s))=\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(\\operatorname{Bar}(B))=\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(\\operatorname{Pred}(P,s))=\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(A\\land B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(A\\lor B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(A\\land B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(A\\lor B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(A)\\cup\\{x\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(\\exists xA)=\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(A)\\cup\\{x\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(\\exists xA)=\\operatorname{BV}_{509}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Subt}_{509}\">\\(\\operatorname{Subt}_{509}\\)</span> 的子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}\nt,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\n\\quad\n0[x:=t]=0,\\quad\n\\langle\\rangle[x:=t]=\\langle\\rangle,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}\nt,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\n\\quad\n0[x:=t]=0,\\quad\n\\langle\\rangle[x:=t]=\\langle\\rangle,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(Su)[x:=t]=S(u[x:=t]),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{cat}(s,n)[x:=t]=\\operatorname{cat}(s[x:=t],n[x:=t]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(Su)[x:=t]=S(u[x:=t]),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{cat}(s,n)[x:=t]=\\operatorname{cat}(s[x:=t],n[x:=t]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{509}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{509}\\)</span> 的非量词子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(u=w)[x:=t]=(u[x:=t]=w[x:=t]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(u=w)[x:=t]=(u[x:=t]=w[x:=t]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{InBar}(B,s)[x:=t]=\n\\operatorname{InBar}(B[x:=t],s[x:=t]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{InBar}(B,s)[x:=t]=\n\\operatorname{InBar}(B[x:=t],s[x:=t]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Bar}(B)[x:=t]=\\operatorname{Bar}(B[x:=t]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Bar}(B)[x:=t]=\\operatorname{Bar}(B[x:=t]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pred}(P,s)[x:=t]=\n\\operatorname{Pred}(P[x:=t],s[x:=t]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pred}(P,s)[x:=t]=\n\\operatorname{Pred}(P[x:=t],s[x:=t]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bot[x:=t]=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bot[x:=t]=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A\\land B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\land B[x:=t],\n\\quad\n(A\\lor B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\lor B[x:=t],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A\\land B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\land B[x:=t],\n\\quad\n(A\\lor B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\lor B[x:=t],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A\\to B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\to B[x:=t].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A\\to B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\to B[x:=t].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>量词子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\forall yA)[x:=t]=\\forall yA,\\quad\n(\\exists yA)[x:=t]=\\exists yA\n\\quad(y=x),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\forall yA)[x:=t]=\\forall yA,\\quad\n(\\exists yA)[x:=t]=\\exists yA\n\\quad(y=x),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\forall yA)[x:=t]=\\forall y(A[x:=t]),\\quad\n(\\exists yA)[x:=t]=\\exists y(A[x:=t])\n\\quad(y\\ne x,\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(t)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\forall yA)[x:=t]=\\forall y(A[x:=t]),\\quad\n(\\exists yA)[x:=t]=\\exists y(A[x:=t])\n\\quad(y\\ne x,\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(t)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\forall yA)[x:=t]=\n\\forall z((A[y:=\\operatorname{var}(z)])[x:=t]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\forall yA)[x:=t]=\n\\forall z((A[y:=\\operatorname{var}(z)])[x:=t]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\exists yA)[x:=t]=\n\\exists z((A[y:=\\operatorname{var}(z)])[x:=t])\n\\quad(y\\ne x,\\ y\\in\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(t)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\exists yA)[x:=t]=\n\\exists z((A[y:=\\operatorname{var}(z)])[x:=t])\n\\quad(y\\ne x,\\ y\\in\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(t)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{509}^r\">\\(y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{509}^r\\)</span> 且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{509}(r,\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{509}(r,\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{509}(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_{509}\">\\(\\mathcal E_{509}\\)</span> 为所有关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\">\\(E\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\)</span> 的集合，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 是等价关系，并满足下列封闭条件：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,A&#39;)\\in E\">\\((A,A&#39;)\\in E\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(B,B&#39;)\\in E\">\\((B,B&#39;)\\in E\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A\\land B,A&#39;\\land B&#39;)\\in E\">\\((A\\land B,A&#39;\\land B&#39;)\\in E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A\\lor B,A&#39;\\lor B&#39;)\\in E\">\\((A\\lor B,A&#39;\\lor B&#39;)\\in E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A\\to B,A&#39;\\to B&#39;)\\in E\">\\((A\\to B,A&#39;\\to B&#39;)\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,A&#39;)\\in E\">\\((A,A&#39;)\\in E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{509}^{s}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{509}^{s}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(QxA,QxA&#39;)\\in E\">\\((QxA,QxA&#39;)\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{509}^{s}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{509}^{s}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{509}(s,\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(B)\\cup\\{x\\})\">\\(z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{509}(s,\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(B)\\cup\\{x\\})\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(QxB,Qz(B[x:=\\operatorname{var}(z)]))\\in E\">\\((QxB,Qz(B[x:=\\operatorname{var}(z)]))\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,509}=\\bigcap\\mathcal E_{509}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_{\\alpha,509}=\\bigcap\\mathcal E_{509}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-公理族\">3. 公理族</h1>\n<p>直觉主义命题公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}^{509}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}^{509}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{A\\land B\\to A,\\ A\\land B\\to B,\\ A\\to(B\\to A\\land B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{A\\land B\\to A,\\ A\\land B\\to B,\\ A\\to(B\\to A\\land B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{A\\to A\\lor B,\\ B\\to A\\lor B,\\ (A\\to C)\\to((B\\to C)\\to(A\\lor B\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{A\\to A\\lor B,\\ B\\to A\\lor B,\\ (A\\to C)\\to((B\\to C)\\to(A\\lor B\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>量词公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q}^{509}\n=\n\\{(\\forall xA)\\to A[x:=t],\\ A[x:=t]\\to\\exists xA:\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{509}^s,\\ t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^s,\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q}^{509}\n=\n\\{(\\forall xA)\\to A[x:=t],\\ A[x:=t]\\to\\exists xA:\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{509}^s,\\ t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^s,\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(A)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(\\exists xA\\to B):x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(B)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(A)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(\\exists xA\\to B):x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(B)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>等词公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{=}^{509}\n=\n\\{t=t:t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^s,\\ s\\in\\mathsf{Sort}_{509}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{t=u\\to(A[x:=t]\\to A[x:=u]):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{509}^s,\\ t,u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^s,\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{=}^{509}\n=\n\\{t=t:t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^s,\\ s\\in\\mathsf{Sort}_{509}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{t=u\\to(A[x:=t]\\to A[x:=u]):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{509}^s,\\ t,u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^s,\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>自然数与序列构造公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Seq}^{509}\n=\n\\{Sx=0\\to\\bot,\\ Sx=Sy\\to x=y:x,y\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^{\\mathsf N}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Seq}^{509}\n=\n\\{Sx=0\\to\\bot,\\ Sx=Sy\\to x=y:x,y\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^{\\mathsf N}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Bar Induction 公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{BI}^{509}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{Bar}(B)\\land\n\\forall s(\\operatorname{InBar}(B,s)\\to\\operatorname{Pred}(P,s))\\land\n\\forall s((\\forall n\\,\\operatorname{Pred}(P,\\operatorname{cat}(s,n)))\\to\\operatorname{Pred}(P,s)))\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Pred}(P,\\langle\\rangle):\nB\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^{\\mathsf Bar},\\ P\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^{\\mathsf Pred},\\ s\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{509}^{\\mathsf Fin},\\ n\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{509}^{\\mathsf N}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{BI}^{509}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{Bar}(B)\\land\n\\forall s(\\operatorname{InBar}(B,s)\\to\\operatorname{Pred}(P,s))\\land\n\\forall s((\\forall n\\,\\operatorname{Pred}(P,\\operatorname{cat}(s,n)))\\to\\operatorname{Pred}(P,s)))\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Pred}(P,\\langle\\rangle):\nB\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^{\\mathsf Bar},\\ P\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^{\\mathsf Pred},\\ s\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{509}^{\\mathsf Fin},\\ n\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{509}^{\\mathsf N}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{509}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}^{509}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q}^{509}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=}^{509}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Seq}^{509}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{BI}^{509}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{509}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}^{509}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q}^{509}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=}^{509}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Seq}^{509}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{BI}^{509}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-规则、证明与可证性\">4. 规则、证明与可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{509}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{509}=\\{((A),\\forall xA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{509}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{509}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{509}=\\{((A),\\forall xA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{509}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{509}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{509}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{509}\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{509}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{509}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{509}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{509}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{509}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{509}\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{509}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{509}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\bigcup_{G\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(G)\">\\(x\\notin\\bigcup_{G\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{509}(G)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,509}A_i\">\\(A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,509}A_i\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{509}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{509}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{509}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{509}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{509}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{509}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{509}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{509}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{509}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{509}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-目标区分\">5. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目的目标增量是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Pred}\">\\(\\mathsf{Pred}\\)</span> 排序和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{BI}^{509}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{BI}^{509}\\)</span>。它不同于 FAN：结论是根节点谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pred}(P,\\langle\\rangle)\">\\(\\operatorname{Pred}(P,\\langle\\rangle)\\)</span>，不是统一有界条覆盖。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-整个句法形式系统\">6. 整个句法形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{BarInd}_{509}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Sort}_{509},\\mathsf{Var}_{509},\\mathsf{Tm}_{509},\\mathsf{Frm}_{509},\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{509},\\operatorname{FV}_{509},\\operatorname{BV}_{509},\\operatorname{Subt}_{509},\\operatorname{Sub}_{509},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,509},\\mathsf{Ax}_{509},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{509},\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{509},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{509},\\vdash_{509}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{BarInd}_{509}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Sort}_{509},\\mathsf{Var}_{509},\\mathsf{Tm}_{509},\\mathsf{Frm}_{509},\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{509},\\operatorname{FV}_{509},\\operatorname{BV}_{509},\\operatorname{Subt}_{509},\\operatorname{Sub}_{509},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,509},\\mathsf{Ax}_{509},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{509},\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{509},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{509},\\vdash_{509}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含有限序列、条谓词、归纳谓词、公理族、规则、证明对象和可证性；不含路径语义、树模型、满足或有效性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始排序与签名","text":"1. 原始排序与签名","level":1},{"id":"2.-项、公式与结构操作","text":"2. 项、公式与结构操作","level":1},{"id":"3.-公理族","text":"3. 公理族","level":1},{"id":"4.-规则、证明与可证性","text":"4. 规则、证明与可证性","level":1},{"id":"5.-目标区分","text":"5. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"6.-整个句法形式系统","text":"6. 整个句法形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Sort}_{509}=\\{\\mathsf N,\\mathsf Fin,\\mathsf Bar,\\mathsf Pred\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}_{509}=\\{v_i^s:i\\in\\mathbb N,s\\in\\mathsf{Sort}_{509}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Var}_{509}^s=\\{v_i^s:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fresh}_{509}(s,X)=v_m^s","display":false},{"tex":"m=\\min\\{i:v_i^s\\notin X\\}","display":false},{"tex":"0:\\mathsf N,\\quad S:\\mathsf N\\to\\mathsf N,\\quad \\langle\\rangle:\\mathsf Fin,\\quad \\operatorname{cat}:\\mathsf Fin,\\mathsf N\\to\\mathsf Fin.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{InBar}:\\mathsf Bar,\\mathsf Fin,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Bar}:\\mathsf Bar,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Pred}:\\mathsf Pred,\\mathsf Fin.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^s","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{509}^s","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{509}^s","display":false},